{"4651130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cleaning Simulator: Ultimate Mess", "steam_appid": 4651130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧼 Cleaning Simulator: Ultimate Mess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn chaos into satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Simulator: Ultimate Mess is a level-based cleaning experience where every job brings a new environment, new tools, and new mechanics. From messy homes to unexpected locations, each level challenges you in a different way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧹 Clean. Fix. Organize.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two levels play the same. You’ll switch between tools and tasks as you restore order:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mop dirty floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and sort trash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrub walls with a sponge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean windows with a wiper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a power washer for heavy dirt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum everything in sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash, hang, and iron clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpack and place items correctly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow the lawn</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏢 Unexpected Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level takes place in a completely different environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Houses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightclubs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even high-profile locations like the Oval Office</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place has its own mess… and its own rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 New Mechanics Every Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just repeating the same cleaning loop.<br>Each level introduces new interactions, tools, and systems to keep things fresh and engaging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛋️ (Planned) Decorate Your Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from an empty environment and turn it into a fully designed space by placing and organizing furniture and items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >😌 Satisfying Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch dirt disappear, chaos turn into order, and messy spaces become perfect again.<br>Simple actions, deeply satisfying results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧼 Cleaning Simulator: Ultimate Mess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn chaos into satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Simulator: Ultimate Mess is a level-based cleaning experience where every job brings a new environment, new tools, and new mechanics. From messy homes to unexpected locations, each level challenges you in a different way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧹 Clean. Fix. Organize.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two levels play the same. You’ll switch between tools and tasks as you restore order:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mop dirty floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and sort trash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrub walls with a sponge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean windows with a wiper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a power washer for heavy dirt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum everything in sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash, hang, and iron clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpack and place items correctly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow the lawn</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏢 Unexpected Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each 